{"ID":"20240118144952-iytbu0g","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144952-iytbu0g","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144952-iytbu0g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144952-43t7tih\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240705114835-xd0x35g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240705114835-xd0x35g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"380补23新绛","type":"doc","updated":"20240705114835"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144952-43t7tih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144952-43t7tih","updated":"20240122170814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】即大红帽之纬也。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170817-exsq1ek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170817-exsq1ek"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】烧炙后用，味苦辛。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170819-mhdl2wc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170819-mhdl2wc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】主要用于止血行血。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170820-f8rd7uc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170820-f8rd7uc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般五分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170821-ag3eyr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170821-ag3eyr8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】忌与活血化血之药同用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170815-73rnyou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170815-73rnyou"}},{"ID":"20240122170821-wj4czfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170821-wj4czfe"}},{"ID":"20240122170822-025z6r2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170822-025z6r2","updated":"20240204170722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第336这个第23我们所谓新绛，新绛这个药呢它是主止血行血。张仲景也是用在这个地方而已，那主要是止血活血使用的，那一般来说这个新绛这个药比较单独，它不会跟一般活血化血的药不放在一起，一起用的哦，所以我们那里面的阿胶可以止血，很多中药能够止血，酸收的药，比如酸枣仁酸收的药，那象刚刚讲的乳香没药通通都可以止血，新绛也可以哦，那新绛呢一般来说这个用的也不多，五分一钱，要烧炙过以后用。那只有一个地方用，那我们到介绍经方时候才介绍哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240705114835-xd0x35g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705114835-xd0x35g"}}]}